not the case. His plan was to pull out on May 1st.&nbsp;

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:14.720
Speaker 1: I basically agree with this. Yeah, I&nbsp;
basically agree with you. And as I outlined in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:20.560
