will be as far as that goes. And number two,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:41.600
getting our people out as well. There could have&nbsp;
been more time and care spent on that. But the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:45.520
idea that Trump would have done it in some perfect&nbsp;
way where this wouldn't have happened or whatever,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:49.040
the part of the reason we've been, there's a lot&nbsp;
of reasons we've been there so long. One of them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:54.480
is just the inertia of one. Once you're doing&nbsp;
something, it takes a lot to get you to change&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:59.040
what you're doing. Contractors were making a ton&nbsp;
of money. It was seen as sort of like, yeah, OK,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:03.440
